  "details": "VRChat Version:\nVRChat2021.3.3  VRCSDK3-WORLD-2021.08.11.15.16_Public\nDescription of the bug:\nCan't hear the right audio on video player.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nWhen the Mode of the \"VRC AVPro Video Speaker\" is set to Stereo Mix, only the left audio is heard; when the Mode is set to Mono Right, nothing is heard.\nThis bug occurs in both UdonSyncPlayer (AVPro).prefab and UdonSyncPlayer (Unity).prefab.\n\n\nThe same goes for video players made by others. For example:\nKineL式VideoPlayer https://booth.pm/ja/items/2758684\nUSharpVideo 1.0 https://github.com/MerlinVR/USharpVideo/releases/tag/v1.0.0\n\n\nHowever, only iwaSync3 played stereo audio without any problems. Perhaps this asset uses its own script.\nhttps://hoshinolabs.booth.pm/items/2666275",
